                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Quite an interesting tactical deck-building game, there are dice and cards to upgrade, and coming from playing Midnight Suns, tactical combat + cards works for me.\r\n\r\nThe game slowly build up a sense of wonder as you meet and control different characters. It made me hope that the two separate parties would eventually band together.\r\n\r\nBut alas, the ending just gave a slap in the face. (Spoiler alert...) All that buildup and hope ultimately led to only two characters remaining, with the characters killing each other because of the \"Zodiarcs\". The game a bit hinting about the Zodiarcs throughout the story, made me hope, but it was left out unexplained/ unexplored in the end. The game just... ended, leaving an underwhelming and unsatisfying conclusion story and gameplay-wise.\r\n\r\nHonestly, better spend your time on some other game",
